player_prompt.intro:
UyisiPlayer {player_id} kwi-3-Player Iterated Prisoner's Dilemma. Umjikelezo ungaqa {num_rounds} izibelo.
Umjikelezo wendlela:
• {conv_rounds} izibelo zokuthetha ngokwenzuzo
• 1 isibelo sokwenza uqondo - thumela ithokheni elilodwa kwi-opponent: '[<opp-id> cooperate]' noma '[<opp-id> defect]' (ngokwesibonelo '[1 defect] [2 cooperate]'; isethuleliyo 'ukuxolela'). 
Matrix yamandla yezigamu (eyakhiwe kwi-gamu ezisilinganayo):
  - Bonke abaxolele  ->  {reward}
  - Bonke abaxolele kabi    ->  {punishment}
  - Wena uxolela kabi, abanye baxolela -> {temptation}
  - Wena uxolela, abanye baxolela kabi -> {sucker}
Oyena mdlali(u) onephepha eliphezulu kwisikhathi sokuphela komjikelezo wozala.
